Hamas contributed to a 34% rise in antisemitic incidents in the U.S. 2021 marked an 11-day war between Israel and militants in Gaza, leading to a death toll of over 240 Palestinians and a dozen Israelis.\\nThe Jewish Federations of North America (JFNA), which represents some 400 Jewish groups in the US, previously told Insiderthere are \\\"no known credible threats to the US Jewish community,\\\" but it is still recommending Jewish facilities to enforce security protocols and coordinate with law enforcement for security.\\nThe conflict has also sparked anti-Islamic violence, including the murder of a 6-year-old boy at the hands of his own landlord, who admitted in court that his murder was due to his family being Muslim.\\nIn 2019, Governor Abbott signed Senate Bill 1828 to establish Holocaust Remembrance Week in Texas public schools to educate students about the Holocaust.\",\"answer\":\"Texas Governor Greg Abbott is combating \\\"misinformation and prejudice\\\" surrounding the Israel-Hamas conflict by providing new state curriculum resources for schools. These materials aim to supplement the teaching of world studies and eliminate ignorance that fuels antisemitism and bigotry. The resources include a guide to conscientious conversations on the Israel-Palestine conflict from the Anti-Defamation League, as well as a guide for parents on discussing violence with their children. The conflict between Israel and Hamas in 2021 led to a rise in antisemitic incidents in the US, and Governor Abbott's initiative seeks to support the Jewish community and promote education on the topic.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":107},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":107,\"byte_end\":261},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":261,\"byte_end\":396},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":396,\"byte_end\":516},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":516,\"byte_end\":633},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":633,\"byte_end\":939},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":939,\"byte_end\":1090},{\"index\":7,\"byte_star