 feet or more at maturity, most sequoia trees will grow at a rate of 3 to 5 feet per year. Seed production begins at 10\u201315 years of age. Source(s): http://www.ehow.com/how_6207859_care-pot...\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how fast do giant sequoias grow\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Based on the given passages, giant sequoias can grow at a rate of 3 to 5 feet per year.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":81},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":81,\"byte_end\":111},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":111,\"byte_end\":125},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":125,\"byte_end\":229},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":229,\"byte_end\":475},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":475,\"byte_end\":582},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":582,\"byte_end\":724},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":724,\"byte_end\":832},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":832,\"byte_end\":1027},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1027,\"byte_end\":1093},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1093,\"byte_end\":1141},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1141,\"byte_end\":1307},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1307,\"byte_end\":1412},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1412,\"byte_end\":1575},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1575,\"byte_end\":1744},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1744,\"byte_end\":1792},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":1792,\"byte_end\":1897}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":87}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
