e adding the steaks will help to caramelize the surfaces of the fish and lock in the moisture.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":46},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":46,\"byte_end\":86},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":86,\"byte_end\":241},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":241,\"byte_end\":364},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":364,\"byte_end\":388},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":388,\"byte_end\":428},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":428,\"byte_end\":697},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":697,\"byte_end\":731},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":731,\"byte_end\":815},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":815,\"byte_end\":938}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":122},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":122,\"byte_end\":182},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":182,\"byte_end\":302},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":302,\"byte_end\":404},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":404,\"byte_end\":540},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":540,\"byte_end\":711}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
