uld likely strike a better deal. \\\"Hillary Clinton would do better. I think everybody on our side, except, maybe, Rand Paul, could do better,\\\" Graham said.\\n\",\"answer\":\"Israeli Prime Minister, Benjamin Netanyahu, has criticised the deal with Iran made by six world powers, which aims to thwart Iran's nuclear ambitions. He told CNN's Jim Acosta that there were better options than \\\"this bad deal or war.\\\" He said: \\\"I think there's a third alternative, and that is standing firm, ratcheting up the pressure until you get a better deal.\\\" His comments come as Democrats and Republicans argue over the framework announced last week to lift Western sanctions on Iran in exchange for the country dropping from 19,000 to 5,060 active centrifuges, limiting its highly enriched uranium, and increasing inspections. The deal has been endorsed by President Barack Obama, however, GOP contenders for the party's 2016 presidential nomination have criticised the deal, saying it gave Iran too much flexibility.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":197},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":197,\"byte_end\":383},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":383,\"byte_end\":652},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":652,\"byte_end\":738},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":738,\"byte_end\":858},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":858,\"byte_end\":893},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":893,\"byte_end\":956},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":956,\"byte_end\":1047},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1047,\"byte_end\":1308},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1308,\"byte_end\":1355},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1355,\"byte_end\":1404},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1404,\"byte_end\":1442},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1442,\"byte_end\":1550},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1550,\"byte_end\":1638},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1638,\"byte_end\":1663},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1663,\"byte_end\":1857},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":1857,\"byte_end\":1938},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":1938,\"byte_end\":2086},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":20