nty of rest and sleep for at least 8 hours a day to help relieve symptoms such as headaches. (Passage 3)\\n\\nTherefore, the treatment for meningitis involves a combination of hydration therapy, pain management, and rest. Antibiotics may not be necessary for mild, viral cases, but should be taken as prescribed by a doctor if the infection is severe or bacterial in nature.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":82},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":82,\"byte_end\":221},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":221,\"byte_end\":415},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":415,\"byte_end\":499},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":499,\"byte_end\":603},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":603,\"byte_end\":834},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":834,\"byte_end\":1014}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":221},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":221,\"byte_end\":308},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":308,\"byte_end\":428},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":428,\"byte_end\":485},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":485,\"byte_end\":600},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":600,\"byte_end\":725},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":725,\"byte_end\":877}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
