2.05.558.399 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"2840-B De La Vina St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":null,\\\"classy\\\":null,\\\"divey\\\":null,\\\"hipster\\\":null,\\\"intimate\\\":null,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":null,\\\"trendy\\\":null,\\\"upscale\\\":null},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":null,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Pizza\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"3:0-22:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-22:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"12:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Lilsy Wood Fired Pizza\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-11-06 19:25:38\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Good wood fired pizza, good price and quick. Better than those non-local places. Support local businesses like this please :)\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-09-19 05:18:41\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"There is no way that this any better than Rustys pizza. And I hate Rustys. It's literally junk. Except you pay $45 for pizza that is beyond mediocre. Way overpriced flavorless dough with basically no cheese and and a smattering of toppings.  The only way this would be acceptable is if you were baked out of your skull.\\\"},{\\\"review_d