l, and coordinating your body for a smooth delivery.\\n2. Analyze your grip: Check your grip on the ball, making sure your fingers are spread apart and leaving a small space between your palm and the ball.\\n3. Practice shooting from different locations: Passage 1 suggests starting with shots in the middle of the paint and then moving to the right and left blocks to practice shooting off the backboard.\\n4. Focus on a consistent release: Aim for a smooth, coordinated release of the ball, with your body, legs, core, and shooting hand all working together.\\n\\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions or if there's anything else I can help with.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":37},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":37,\"byte_end\":116},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":116,\"byte_end\":216},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":216,\"byte_end\":439},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":439,\"byte_end\":627},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":627,\"byte_end\":766},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":766,\"byte_end\":819},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":819,\"byte_end\":841},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":841,\"byte_end\":911},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":911,\"byte_end\":1018},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1018,\"byte_end\":1100},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1100,\"byte_end\":1285}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":244},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":244,\"byte_end\":383},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":383,\"byte_end\":534},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":534,\"byte_end\":732},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":732,\"byte_end\":886},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":886,\"byte_end\":905},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":905,\"byte_end\":995}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
