aming, fill a pot with 2 to 3 inches of water and set a steamer basket on top so that it sits above the water. Bring the water to a boil over high heat. Lay the baby broccoli in the steamer basket and place the lid on top. Steam the broccoli for 2 to 3 minutes, or until the stalks and florets brighten in color and become tender. Make sure to wash and trim the stalks before cooking. Serve warm.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":70},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":70,\"byte_end\":123},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":123,\"byte_end\":230},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":230,\"byte_end\":313},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":313,\"byte_end\":325},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":325,\"byte_end\":463},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":463,\"byte_end\":538},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":538,\"byte_end\":597},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":597,\"byte_end\":774},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":774,\"byte_end\":845},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":845,\"byte_end\":887},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":887,\"byte_end\":957},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":957,\"byte_end\":1070},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1070,\"byte_end\":1082},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1082,\"byte_end\":1155}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[8,9,10],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":61},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":61,\"byte_end\":174},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":174,\"byte_end\":287},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":287,\"byte_end\":370},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":370,\"byte_end\":437},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":437,\"byte_end\":555},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":555,\"byte_end\":597},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":597,\"byte_end\":667},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":667,\"byte_end\":775},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":775,\"byte_end\":829},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":829,\"byte_end\":840}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
