tricity: Nuclear energy is used to produce electricity by generating heat from the splitting of uranium atoms in a process called fission.\\n2. Powerful and efficient: Nuclear energy is more powerful and efficient than other alternative energy sources, making it a viable option for many countries.\\n3. Reliable: Unlike traditional sources of energy, nuclear energy can be produced even in rough weather conditions, providing a reliable source of electricity.\\n4. Reduces greenhouse gas emissions: The generation of electricity through nuclear energy reduces the amount of energy generated from fossil fuels, resulting in lower greenhouse gas emissions.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":70},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":70,\"byte_end\":340},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":340,\"byte_end\":617},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":617,\"byte_end\":779},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":779,\"byte_end\":1060},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1060,\"byte_end\":1138},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1138,\"byte_end\":1385},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1385,\"byte_end\":1522}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":232},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":232,\"byte_end\":390},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":390,\"byte_end\":550},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":550,\"byte_end\":742}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
