\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"5 star acai bowl, service, and location.  So impressed with this last minute find.  It ended up being a light dinner kinda night for us and with not much open at almost 8pm, but these bowls hit the spot.  \\\\n\\\\nOnce you choose the size you want, there is a large list of toppings which are unlimited.  I chose everything that sounded good and I was so impressed with how well they all went together.  My first time having peanut butter with my acai and chai pudding but it messed well.  Fresh, flavorful and filling.  \\\\n\\\\nI know where to stop now when in Santa Barbara.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Oakberry A\u00e7a\u00ed Bowls and Smoothies is a local business located at 819-B State St in Santa Barbara, CA. They offer a range of products and services in the categories of Coffee & Tea, Restaurants, Cafes, Food, Acai Bowls, and Juice Bars & Smoothies. The business has varying operating hours throughout the week, opening at 8:00 AM and closing at either 8:00 PM or 9:00 PM depending on the day.\\n\\nAccording to customer reviews, Oakberry A\u00e7a\u00ed Bowls and Smoothies is highly regarded for its quality and variety of a\u00e7a\u00ed bowls. One reviewer praised the fresh fruit options and the wide selection of toppings available. They mentioned that the a\u00e7a\u00ed was slightly thinner than other types they have tried before, but still flavorful. The addition of chai pudding as a topping was a pleasant surprise.\\n\\nAnother customer appreciated the business as a convenient spot for a quick lunch or pick-me-up. They particularly liked the gluten-free options and the ability to customize their bowl with toppings like coconut, peanut butter, bananas, strawberries, and granola. However, they mentioned that they found the prices to be slightly high.\\n\\nOverall, Oakberry A\u00e7a\u00ed Bowls and Smoothies has received positive feedback for its delicious a\u00e7a\u00ed bowls, attentive service, and convenient location. Customers have expressed their intention to visit again, making it a recommended choice for a satisfying and healthy snack or light meal in Santa Barbara.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":655},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":655,\"byte_end\":715},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":715,\"byte_end\":778},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":778,\"byte_end\":857},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":857,\"byte_end\":950},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":950,\"byte_end\":1104},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1104,\"byte_end\":1180},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1180,\"byte_end\":1253},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1253,\"byte_end\":1437},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1437,\"byte_end\":1479},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1479,\"byte_end\":1600},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1600,\"byte_end\":1695},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1695,\"byte_end\":1794},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1794,\"byte_end\":1880},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1880,\"byte_end\":1911},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1911,\"byte_end\":1979}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":104},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":104,\"byte_end\":249},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":249,\"byte_end\":394},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":394,\"byte_end\":525},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":525,\"byte_end\":616},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":616,\"byte_end\":730},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":730,\"byte_end\":798},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":798,\"byte_end\":894},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":894,\"byte_end\":1061},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1061,\"byte_end\":1134},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1134,\"byte_end\":1286},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1286,\"byte_end\":1440}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
