g to prevent overwatering.\\n* Add 2-3 inches of gravel to the bottom of the container for drainage.\\n* Fill the container about 3/4 full with bagged potting soil to start.\\n* Plant 3-4 marigold seedlings with each tomato seedling to keep pests away.\\n* Plant tomato seedlings so that the soil is just below the first set of true leaves.\\n* Water thoroughly after planting.\\n* Keep container tomatoes in full sun (about 8 hours a day).\\n* Check containers regularly for water and pests, and use mulch to conserve soil moisture.\\n\\nIt's important to note that growing tomatoes in containers can be challenging due to the limited space and potential overwatering. Be sure to monitor the moisture levels and take steps to avoid root rot. Additionally, consider using a container that is specifically designed for tomato plants, such as a grow-through pot or a hanging basket, to give the plants more room to grow and better air circulation.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":66},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":66,\"byte_end\":143},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":143,\"byte_end\":214},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":214,\"byte_end\":285},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":285,\"byte_end\":336},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":336,\"byte_end\":396},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":396,\"byte_end\":467},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":467,\"byte_end\":565},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":565,\"byte_end\":631},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":631,\"byte_end\":809},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":809,\"byte_end\":848},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":848,\"byte_end\":940},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":940,\"byte_end\":1140},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1140,\"byte_end\":1181},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1181,\"byte_end\":1308},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1308,\"byte_end\":1426}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":220},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":220,\"byte_end\":292},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":292,\"byte_end\":363},{\"inde