-09 02:41:42\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Rude. Just absolutely rude.  It's sad to see hospitality take a back seat. Walked out without even ordering.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-17 21:09:37\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Years later and I still love this place. I am a rabid sushi fan who eats sushi at least once a week if I can afford it. (Why don't other restaurants offer this amazing Sushiya roll?) I went there so often the entire staff knew me by name. They are so friendly and always ask me about school. Even after graduating, I would still go back. It's a pain to drive in Isla Vista but it is WORTH it for this restaurant. Don't be fooled by the quality of the surrounding Isla Vista restaurants: this place is delicious, high quality, fresh, and fast. I have never been disappointed. It is a truly wonderful family-owned and operated small business with nice indoor & outdoor seating, mere steps from the beach. Don't sleep on this place. It may be in a student area but it is higher quality & more affordable than Sushi Teri etc. I've eaten here more times than I care to count, & will return whenever I'm in the area.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Based on the provided structured data, here is an objective overview of Sushiya Express:\\n\\nSushiya Express is a local business located in Goleta, California, offering a variety of dining options including sushi, catering, event planning, and food delivery services. The business has received mixed reviews from customers, with some praising its high-quality sushi and friendly service, while others have complained about price increases and poor customer experience.\\n\\nThe business is open seven days a week from 12:00 pm to 21:00 pm, with free WiFi available. It also offers outdoor seating and takes reservations, although it does not validate parking. According to customers, the ambiance is casual and suitable for groups, although one reviewer described it as \\\"trendy\\\" and \\\"upscale.\\\"\\n\\nOn the positive side, many reviewers have praised the quality of the sushi, with one reviewer stating that it is \\\"amazing\\\" and \\\"highly affordable.\\\" Some have also commended the friendliness and professionalism of the staff, with one reviewer describing them as \\\"nicely dressed\\\" and \\\"always asking about school.\\\"\\n\\nHowever, several reviewers have expressed dissatisfaction with the recent price increases and perceived decline in quality. One reviewer stated that the prices are now \\\"Nobu-level\\\" and that the sushi is \\\"mediocre,\\\" while another reported a negative experience with rude staff.\\n\\nIn conclusion, Sushiya Express appears to be a popular local business with both strengths and weaknesses. While some customers enjoy its high-quality sushi and casual atmosphere, others have criticized its price increases and poor customer service.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":1015},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":1015,\"byte_end\":1075},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1075,\"byte_end\":1167},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1167,\"byte_end\":1190},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1190,\"byte_end\":1236},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1236,\"byte_end\":1384},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1384,\"byte_end\":1463},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1463,\"byte_end\":1526},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1526,\"byte_end\":1582},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1582,\"byte_end\":1635},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1635,\"byte_end\":1681},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1681,\"byte_end\":1756},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1756,\"byte_end\":1886},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1886,\"byte_end\":1918},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1918,\"byte_end\":2046},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2046,\"byte_end\":2073},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2073,\"byte_end\":2270}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":265},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":265,\"byte_end