4.09.447.007 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"Senator Cruz Introduces Bill Preventing Schools From Supporting Illegal Immigrants\\nEarlier this year, a New York Representative passed a bill to prevent schools from receiving aid if they house illegal immigrants. Now, Senator Ted Cruz is introducing a Senate version of the bill. It\u2019s called \u201cThe Schools Not Shelters Act\u201d.\\nRepublican Representative Marc Molinaro of New York introduced the bill earlier this year. It passed along with the support of four Democrats.\\nCruz wants to ensure schools don\u2019t become shelters for illegal immigrants. According to the senator, taxpayer funds should not have to be the solution to support illegal immigrants at the expense of children attending school.\\nAccording to Fox 26, Senator Cruz said:\\n\\\"Under Joe Biden, we have a wide-open southern border. The Biden Border Crisis has created the largest illegal immigration crisis in our nation's history. Biden's open borders are an invitation for cartels to brutalize children, assault women, overrun our communities with illegal aliens, and flood this country with narcotics and fentanyl. These drugs kill over 100,000 people per year.\u201d\\n\u201cThis bill would stop the Biden Border Crisis dead in its tracks by building the wall, ratcheting up asylum standards, increasing the number of Border Patrol Agents, and implementing effective border security policies.\\\"\\nIn a statement, Cruz said according to Fox News:\\n\\\"The invasion at our southern border is straining local services, overwhelming hospitals, and overcrowding schools. To make matters worse, leftist sanctuary cities are even using K-12 schools and college campuses as housing for illegal aliens.\\\"\\n\\\"Instead of addressing the learning loss caused by Democrat COVID lockdowns, sanctuary cities are focused on diverting resources from students to house illegal aliens. Students are losing access to gyms, dorms, and other school facilities in order to accommodate illegal aliens. Housing unvetted, potentially dangerous illegal aliens in schools is a recipe for disaster.\\\"\\nSenator Cruz argues President Biden\u2019s policies have not helped keep America\u2019s borders safe.\\nCongressman Bob Good shares his thoughts on the bill.\\nWhat do you think about this bill?\",\"answer\":\"Senator Ted Cruz has introduced a bill called \\\"The Schools Not Shelters Act\\\" to prevent schools from supporting illegal immigrants. The bill aims to ensure that taxpayer funds are not used to support illegal immigrants at the expense of children attending school. Cruz argues that President Biden's open borders policy has created the largest illegal immigration crisis in the nation's history, leading to strain on local services and overcrowding in schools. The bill proposes building a wall, increasing Border Patrol Agents, and implementing effective border security policies to address the issue.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":214},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":214,\"byte_end\":281},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":281,\"byte_end\":331},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":331,\"byte_end\":422},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":422,\"byte_end\":474},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":474,\"byte_end\":551},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":551,\"byte_end\":702},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":702,\"byte_end\":797},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":797,\"byte_end\":897},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":897,\"byte_end\":1083},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1083,\"byte_end\":1133},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1133,\"byte_end\":1355},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1355,\"byte_end\":1520},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1520,\"byte_end\":1649},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1649,\"byte_end\":1817},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1817,\"byte_end\":1928},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":1928,\"byte_end\":2021},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2021,\"byte_end\":2117},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":2117,\"byte_end\":2171},{\"index\":19,\"byte_start\":2171,\"byte_end\":2205}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":132},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":132,\"byte_end\":264},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":264,\"byte_end\":460},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":460,\"byte_end\":601}]}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
4.09.447.007 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"prompt":"<|im_start|>user\n{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"Senator Cruz Introduces Bill Preventing Schools From Supporting Illegal Immigrants\\nEarlier this year, a New York Representative passed a bill to prevent schools from receiving aid if they house illegal immigrants. Now, Senator Ted Cruz is introducing a Senate version of the bill. It’s called “The Schools Not Shelters Act”.\\nRepublican Representative Marc Molinaro of New York introduced the bill earlier this year. It passed along with the support of four Democrats.\\nCruz wants to ensure schools don’t become shelters for illegal immigrants. According to the senator, taxpayer funds should not have to be the solution to support illegal immigrants at the expense of children attending school.\\nAccording to Fox 26, Senator Cruz said:\\n\\\"Under Joe Biden, we have a wide-open southern border. The Biden Border Crisis has created the largest illegal immigration crisis in our nation's history. Biden's open borders are an invitation for cartels to brutalize children, assault women, overrun our communities with illegal aliens, and flood this country with narcotics and fentanyl. These drugs kill over 100,000 people per year.”\\n“This bill would stop the Biden Border Crisis dead in its tracks by building the wall, ratcheting up asylum standards, increasing the number of Border Patrol Agents, and implementing effective border security policies.\\\"\\nIn a statement, Cruz said according to Fox News:\\n\\\"The invasion at our southern border is straining local services, overwhelming hospitals, and overcrowding schools. To make matters worse, leftist sanctuary cities are even using K-12 schools and college campuses as housing for illegal aliens.\\\"\\n\\\"Instead of addressing the learning loss caused by Democrat COVID lockdowns, sanctuary cities are focused on diverting resources from students to house illegal aliens. Students are losing access to gyms, dorms, and other school facilities in order to accommodate illegal aliens. Housing unvetted, potentially dangerous illegal aliens in schools is a recipe for disaster.\\\"\\nSenator Cruz argues President Biden’s policies have not helped keep America’s borders safe.\\nCongressman Bob Good shares his thoughts on the bill.\\nWhat do you think about this bill?\",\"answer\":\"Senator Ted Cruz has introduced a bill called \\\"The Schools Not Shelters Act\\\" to prevent schools from supporting illegal immigrants. The bill aims to ensure that taxpayer funds are not used to support illegal immigrants at the expense of children attending school. Cruz argues that President Biden's open borders policy has created the largest illegal immigration crisis in the nation's history, leading to strain on local services and overcrowding in schools. The bill proposes building a wall, increasing Border Patrol Agents, and implementing effective border security policies to address the issue.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":214},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":214,\"byte_end\":281},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":281,\"byte_end\":331},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":331,\"byte_end\":422},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":422,\"byte_end\":474},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":474,\"byte_end\":551},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":551,\"byte_end\":702},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":702,\"byte_end\":797},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":797,\"byte_end\":897},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":897,\"byte_end\":1083},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1083,\"byte_end\":1133},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1133,\"byte_end\":1355},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1355,\"byte_end\":1520},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1520,\"byte_end\":1649},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1649,\"byte_end\":1817},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1817,\"b