eve this place is closed. I had a lovely dinner here with my cousins last year. The decor and ambiance is amazing. \\\\n\\\\nI loved all my dishes - the empanadas, ravioli, and the birthday cake. I'll miss this place :(\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Cafe Buenos Aires is a now-closed Argentine restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA. The restaurant offered a variety of traditional Argentine dishes, including empanadas, ravioli, and birthday cake. The atmosphere was described as romantic and intimate, with outdoor seating available. The restaurant accepted reservations and had Wi-Fi available. Some reviewers noted that the restaurant was not very touristy or trendy, but instead offered a cozy and authentic dining experience. The restaurant had a 3.5-star rating and was praised for its delicious food and pleasant atmosphere. However, it has since closed down, much to the disappointment of some loyal customers who enjoyed dining there.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":1017},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":1017,\"byte_end\":1031},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1031,\"byte_end\":1090},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1090,\"byte_end\":1285},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1285,\"byte_end\":1339},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1339,\"byte_end\":1374},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1374,\"byte_end\":1449},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1449,\"byte_end\":1489}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":85},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":85,\"byte_end\":200},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":200,\"byte_end\":287},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":287,\"byte_end\":349},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":349,\"byte_end\":483},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":483,\"byte_end\":584},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":584,\"byte_end\":695}]}"}], "temperature": 0, "seed": 70781, "max_tokens": 256, "stream": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "grammar": "root ::= r0 \"\\n\" r1 \"\\n\" r2 \"\\n\" r3 \"\\n\