ars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Very popular casual dining right on the beach. \\\\nHad the fish tacos, ceviche, quesadillas, enchilada. Everything fresh and tasty. We got a couple of beers to go with and it was just a picture perfect day meal out. \\\\nLove this place and the great service but the view is worth getting here\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Shoreline Beach Cafe is a restaurant located at 801 Shoreline Dr in Santa Barbara, California. The business offers a variety of cuisines such as burgers, American traditional, tacos, seafood, and Mexican food. The cafe has outdoor seating and allows customers to enjoy their meals while sitting in the sand. The restaurant also provides takeout services and is suitable for groups. According to the reviews, the food quality is good, the service is excellent, and the atmosphere is great. However, some customers have noted that the ambiance could be improved and the parking situation is not ideal. Despite these concerns, many customers are satisfied with their experience at Shoreline Beach Cafe and plan to return for another visit.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":857},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":857,\"byte_end\":903},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":903,\"byte_end\":964},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":964,\"byte_end\":1113},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1113,\"byte_end\":1273},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1273,\"byte_end\":1328},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1328,\"byte_end\":1356},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1356,\"byte_end\":1440},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1440,\"byte_end\":1531}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":95},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":95,\"byte_end\":210},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":210,\"byte_end\":308},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":308,\"byte_end\":382},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":382,\"byte_end\":489},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":489,\"byte_end\":600},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":600,\"byte_end