e roastery services. They are open Monday through Sunday from 6:30 am to 8:00 pm. The business provides free Wi-Fi and takeout options. The business has a rating of 4.0 out of 5.0 stars on Google. However, recent reviews suggest that they have made mistakes in shipping their products, leading to frustration and loss of customers. Customers also commented on the poor customer service and difficulty in using their coupon cards. Despite these issues, some customers appreciate the quality of their coffee and the unique experience of watching the roasting process.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":827},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":827,\"byte_end\":1131},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1131,\"byte_end\":1263},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1263,\"byte_end\":1291},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1291,\"byte_end\":1552},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1552,\"byte_end\":1589},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1589,\"byte_end\":1698},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1698,\"byte_end\":1795},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1795,\"byte_end\":2006},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":2006,\"byte_end\":2032},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":2032,\"byte_end\":2120},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":2120,\"byte_end\":2367},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":2367,\"byte_end\":2486},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":2486,\"byte_end\":2625},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2625,\"byte_end\":2689},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2689,\"byte_end\":2810},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2810,\"byte_end\":3017},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":3017,\"byte_end\":3121}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":102},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":102,\"byte_end\":179},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":179,\"byte_end\":240},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":240,\"byte_end\":294},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":294,\"byte_end\":355},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":355,\"byte_end\":490},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":490,\"byte_end\":588},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":588,\"byte_end\":723}]}<|im_e