s the best purple worms they have ever had. The chocolate chip cookies are also highly recommended, and the salads are all amazing. The quiche on the weekend, especially the bacon, is a standout dish. Overall, Merci To Go is a great place to grab a quick bite to go, with excellent food options and a casual atmosphere.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":921},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":921,\"byte_end\":1041},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1041,\"byte_end\":1327},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1327,\"byte_end\":1805},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1805,\"byte_end\":1858},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1858,\"byte_end\":1879},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1879,\"byte_end\":1943},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1943,\"byte_end\":2059},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":2059,\"byte_end\":2201},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":2201,\"byte_end\":2230},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":2230,\"byte_end\":2291},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":2291,\"byte_end\":2332}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[8,9,10,11],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":96},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":96,\"byte_end\":168},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":168,\"byte_end\":281},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":281,\"byte_end\":353},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":353,\"byte_end\":529},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":529,\"byte_end\":591},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":591,\"byte_end\":700},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":700,\"byte_end\":822},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":822,\"byte_end\":945},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":945,\"byte_end\":1033},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1033,\"byte_end\":1102},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1102,\"byte_end\":1220}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
