pt":"<|im_start|>user\n{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"1024 Coast Village Rd\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Food, Cafes, Bakeries, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:0-18:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:0-18:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:0-18:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:0-18:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Merci To Go\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-12-29 02:06:36\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Merci To Go is located at the Montecito Country Mart with its own free parking lot (at the front and the back).\\\\n\\\\nIt's a great place to grab a quick bite to go. And when I say great place, I meant the food is great.\\\\n\\\\nYou can eat very good food AND not have to be fussy about it. Go in you PJ's, line up, point at what you want, pay and then walk out and eat your food wherever you are comfortable.\\\\n\\\\nAnd with you to-go item, you can be feasting on a great baguette, a duck confit and a well-dressed salad.\\\\n\\\\nThere are drinks available too.\\\\n\\\\nMasks are required. Number of people are limited indoors so there is a line starting from the door.\\\\n\\\\nAt the time of my visit, outdoor dining was still allowed so there were patio furniture set up and some people were availing themselves of it.\\\\n\\\\nWhich was great because next door is Caffe Luxxe!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-08-29 21:44:41\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"My buddy kept telling me, \\\\\\\"MTG has the best purple worms I've ever had.\\\\\\\" Now I love worms, eat em all the time, but purple? And not underground by the La Colina baseball field? We I gotta see this. So I go for a taste, and low and behold, WEVE GOT WORMS PEOPLE! The waitress kept saying they were octo-somethin and they come from the SEA, but I know a damn worm when I see one. 10/10 love this place!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2016-12-01 19:54:43\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Best chocolate chip cookies you'll ever eat.  The salads are all amazing.  The quiche on the weekend (bacon especially) can't be beat.  Definitely worth a stop.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Merci To Go is a food business located at 1024 Coast Village Road in Santa Barbara, California. It belongs to the categories of Food, Cafes, Bakeries, and Restaurants. The business operates from Tuesday to Friday from 11:00 am to 6:00 pm and on Saturday from 11:00 am to 5:00 pm.\\n\\nThe business offers takeout options, outdoor seating, and free parking. Customers can enjoy good food without being fussy, as they can simply line up, point at what they want, pay and then walk out and eat their food wherever they are comfortable. The menu includes baguettes, duck confit, salads, and drinks. Masks are required, and the number of people are limited indoors, so there is a line starting from the door. At the time of the review, outdoor dining was still allowed, and there were patio furniture set up for customers to use.\\n\\nAccording to customer reviews, Merci To Go has excellent food options and serves the best purple worms they have ever had. The chocolate chip cookies are also highly recommended, and the salads are all amazing. The quiche on the weekend, especially the bacon, is a standout dish. Overall, Merci To Go is a great place to grab a quick bite to go, with excellent food options and a casual atmosphere.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":921},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":921,\"byte_end\":1041},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1041,\"byte_end\":1327},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1327,\"byte_end\":1805},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1805,\"byte_end\":1858},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1858,\"byte_end\":1879},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1879,\"byte_end\":1943},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1943,\"byte_end\":2059},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":2059,\"byte_end\":2201},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":2201,\"byte_end\":2230},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":2230,\"byte_end\":2291},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":2291,\"byte_end\":2332}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[8,9,10,11],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":96},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":96,\"byte_end\":168},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":168,\"byte_end\":281},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":281,\"byte_end\":353},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":353,\"byte_end\":529},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":529,\"byte_end\":591},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":591,\"byte_end\":700},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":700,\"byte_end\":822},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":822,\"byte_end\":945},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":945,\"byte_end\":1033},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1033,\"byte_end\":1102},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1102,\"byte_end\":1220}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
