7.28.144.465 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"519 State St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":null,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Dance Clubs, Nightlife\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":null,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Statemynt\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2016-03-16 19:24:54\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Late Post from Saturday 6/13/15\\\\n(Sorry for the delay in posting, I guess I didn't finish...)\\\\n\\\\nA date & I were walking along state street on a Saturday night after leaving another restaurant (Baja) that was charging an entrance fee (a UFC Fight was on). We heard music & saw it was somewhat empty. We thought ok, cool. I like when its not too busy, so I can get quick service. All the bartenders were nice. I didn't get his name, but he helped us & served us quick, very knowledgable about drinks. Seemed like the DJ was setting up for the night.. I enjoyed his mixes, kept me thinking what song was coming on next. They had a projection on the wall playing videos. Which I like when at a bar. But it was playing on the wall, not on a projection screen, but the actual wall.\\\\n\\\\nAnyway, we were enjoying ourselves w/ the music & the vibe. Until, it started to get busy.  We were sitting at the bar while there were people standing behind us. Well that group of people just got there, had drinks in their hand & Idk if they were arguing w/ each other or just plain sloppy, but one of them either threw or dropped their glass of beer. Beer & broken glass pieces all over the floor. Someone came, swept & cleaned everything up. Then everyone went back to their business... So a song that I like came on & I decided I wanted to get up to dance. As soon as I stood up I hear a \\\\\\\"crack\\\\\\\"! Apparently there was a piece glass on the floor next me. As soon as I got down from the bar seat & stepped on the ground the piece of glass pierced the bottom of my foot. Ouch!! Man! That freakin hurt. All I saw on my foot was blood. I was bleeding & asking the bartender for napkins to stop the blood. I had to tell the bartender/worker what happened. They just ask if I was ok. I said no, but I'll be ok. I think he was asking if I wanted drink, I just asked for a band aid. Then when I felt able to walk we left. That really ruined my night in SB & totally killed our buzz. \\\\n\\\\nDon't know if I'll return, but if I do, I hope nothing like that happens again.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2015-11-02 02:18:03\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Made the mistake of going Halloween night thinking it would be fun but the bartenders ignored us for 20+ minutes. After an order mix up one of the bartenders called me and my friends idiots- he was so incredibly rude. Makes me not really want to go there again. Go somewhere else!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2015-10-12 02:08:59\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Bar sucks for singles. The bar tinder is kind of a dick. They treat singles like trash. And don't want to serve them new drinks. You will walk in and feel good and then used and want to leave right away.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Based on the provided structured data in JSON format, here is an objective overview of the local business Statemynt in Santa Barbara, California:\\n\\nName: Statemynt\\nAddress: 519 State St, Santa Barbara, CA\\nCategories: Dance Clubs, Nightlife\\nHours: None\\nAttributes: Outdoor Seating, WiFi, Restaurants Take Out, Restaurants Good For Groups, Music, Ambience (romantic, intimate, touristy, hipster, divey, classy, trendy, upscale, casual)\\nReview Information:\\n\\n* Review score: 3.5 out of 5 stars\\n* Total number of reviews: 3\\n* Latest review date: November 2, 2015\\n\\nThe reviews for Statemynt have been mixed, with some patrons enjoying their experience and others having negative encounters. One reviewer praised the bar's atmosphere, music, and bartenders, but had a negative experience when a piece of broken glass on the floor caused them to injure their foot. Another reviewer reported being ignored by the bartenders for 20 minutes and receiving rude treatment. A third reviewer complained that the bar is not welcoming to singles.\\n\\nOverall, Statemynt appears to have a lively atmosphere and a good selection of drinks, but some patrons have experienced poor service and safety issues. It may be worth visiting with caution and being aware of your surroundings to avoid any potential hazards.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":881},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":881,\"byte_end\":925},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":925,\"byte_end\":946},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":946,\"byte_end\":1004},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1004,\"byte_end\":1034},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1034,\"byte_end\":1125},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1125,\"byte_end\":1175},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1175,\"byte_end\":1243},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1243,\"byte_end\":1293},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1293,\"byte_end\":1321},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1321,\"byte_end\":1465},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1465,\"byte_end\":14