ovide great recommendations. One reviewer praised the restaurant's fruity cocktails, while another enjoyed their mojito. However, one customer was disappointed with the quality of the salmon dish, finding it overcooked and containing fish bones.\\n\\nThe restaurant offers Happy Hour specials from 4pm-7pm daily, with small plates priced at $5, all beers at $4, all house wines at $5, and all well cocktails at $6 or $8 for a bartender's choice cocktail. Parking is available at the hotel for $25 per night, or customers can find street parking nearby.\\n\\nOverall, Bistro 1111 appears to be a solid choice for breakfast and brunch in Santa Barbara, offering a range of dishes and drinks in a casual, classy atmosphere with friendly service.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":894},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":894,\"byte_end\":942},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":942,\"byte_end\":1009},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1009,\"byte_end\":1119},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1119,\"byte_end\":1152},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1152,\"byte_end\":1221},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1221,\"byte_end\":1304},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1304,\"byte_end\":1374},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1374,\"byte_end\":1453},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1453,\"byte_end\":1542},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1542,\"byte_end\":2243},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":2243,\"byte_end\":2267},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":2267,\"byte_end\":2323},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":2323,\"byte_end\":2378},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2378,\"byte_end\":2462},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2462,\"byte_end\":2553},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2553,\"byte_end\":2582},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2582,\"byte_end\":2652}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[8,9],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":6},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":6,\"byte_end\":184},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":184,\"byte_end\":328},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":328,\"byte_end\":426},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":426,\"byte_end\":556